					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="903" height="1038" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Upcoming LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighborhood November 2026 &amp; 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Sets Revealed Front &amp; Back Box" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box.jpg 903w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-261x300.jpg 261w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-891x1024.jpg 891w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Upcoming-LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Sets-Revealed-Front-Back-Box-768x883.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 903px) 100vw, 903px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>The all-new LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set promotion is now live at</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-icons-venetian-water-taxi-gwp-gift-with-purchase-promotion-now-live-november-1-8-2026/">LEGO Icons Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase Promotion Now Live: November 1-8, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113621 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="905" height="760" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-1024x860.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Front-Box-768x645.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 905px) 100vw, 905px" /></p>
<p>The all-new LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set promotion is now live at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This Water Taxi gift set is free when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set. Promotion runs from November 1-8, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113625 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="944" height="791" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-300x252.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-1024x858.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-40898-Venetian-Water-Taxi-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Revealed-Back-Box-768x644.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 944px) 100vw, 944px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="848" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113610 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png" alt="" width="1200" height="675" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-300x169.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-768x432.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113620 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="797" height="778" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x293.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x999.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Icons-11388-Venetian-Neighborhood-November-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x749.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" /></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that the LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD LEGO purchase promotion at is still running as well. Valid from October 28 to November 8, 2026 or while supplies last at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). This means that when you <strong>purchase the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set</strong>, you can get up to<strong> two FREE LEGO gift with purchases</strong> (40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP and 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP).</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113737 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="710" height="826" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 710px) 100vw, 710px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113742 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="706" height="822" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 706px) 100vw, 706px" /></p>
<p><strong>Wondering what are the new LEGO November 2026 Releases? Be sure to <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/every-lego-november-2026-new-set-releases-list-sagrada-familia-cozy-plants-venetian-neighborhood-and-dragon-ball-shenron-goku/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">check out our guide over here</a>!</strong> Shown below are images of some of the sets releasing on November 1, 2026 at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113021 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="937" height="937" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-11390-Dragon-Ball-Shenron-Goku-Icons-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 937px) 100vw, 937px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112635 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="670" height="780" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Botanicals-10371-Cozy-Plants-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 670px) 100vw, 670px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109141 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1049" height="1049" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18-LEGO-Architecture-21065-Sagrada-Familia-November-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1049px) 100vw, 1049px" /></p>
<p>As a friendly reminder, there are are still a large selection of LEGO sets retiring soon at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). <strong>See What&#8217;s Retiring Soon at the Official LEGO Site over here:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fretiring-soon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that there&#8217;s still a good selection of LEGO sets discounted as well. <strong>See LEGO Sales &amp; Deals List:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fsales-and-deals" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks as we regularly update and inform all of our readers of the latest LEGO Promotions, GWP and Sales &amp; Deals.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO November 2026 Promotions &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>November 1-8, 2026 (Worldwide):</strong> Free LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP Gift with Purchase set when you buy the new Icons 11388 Venetian Neighbourhood set</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (Worldwide): </strong>Free LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD LEGO purchase</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30685 TIE Interceptor Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (US, Canada &amp; Australia only):</strong> Free LEGO Harry Potter 30724 Dumbledore&#8217;s Office with <span style="text-decoration: underline;">SELECTED</span> LEGO Harry Potter purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD</li>
<li><strong>October 28-November 8, 2026 (UK only):</strong> Free LEGO Star Wars 30727 TIE Advanced Mini-Build GWP with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than £35 GBP</li>
<li><strong>Until November 20, 2026 (Australia only):</strong> Free 18+ LEGO 40768 Star Trek Type-15 Shuttlepod GWP with purchase of the 18+ LEGO Icons Star Trek U.S.S. Enterprise NCC-1701-D 10356 set</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
