		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114037</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="2560" height="2560" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO 11371 Shopping Street Modular Building" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/11371_Lifestyle_Cons_crop-2048x2048.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" /></p>
<p>I love picking up a regular LEGO set from the shop shelf, assembling it, and displaying it somewhere</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/tips-tricks-how-to-expand-upgrade-and-light-up-your-lego-modular-sets/">[Tips &#038; Tricks] How to Expand, Upgrade, and Light Up Your LEGO Modular Sets</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-95689 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings.jpg 1600w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/iDisplayIT-LEGO-Display-Case-Review-Modular-Buildings-1536x1152.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" /><br />
<span style="font-weight: 400;">I love picking up a regular LEGO set from the shop shelf, assembling it, and displaying it somewhere in my home. However, sometimes I feel that puts a cap on my creativity, which is where modular sets come in. And if I must confess, I am still learning how to expand, upgrade, and light up LEGO modular sets.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can design your own modular sets, use fan designs, or choose official LEGO modular sets. I’d say go with the latter if you are starting modular creations for the first time. As you master the builds, you can progress to creating your own designs or going with what other fans have created.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This guide will teach you how to expand, upgrade, and light up LEGO modular sets. You’ll learn the basics of starting with one building and upgrading to a full city on display.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Takeaways</span></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Most official LEGO modular sets have hidden easter eggs.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The modular sets have a “clip together” feature that you can use to join multiple sets together.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can design your layout digitally before you start building.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-85601 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="902" height="890" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Front-Box.jpg 902w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Front-Box-768x758.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 902px) 100vw, 902px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">An Overview of LEGO Modular Sets</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One thing I love about modular sets is that LEGO created them with interconnectivity in mind. In other words, you can bring all of them together to create a city landscape, which is what all the nerds go after.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO introduced the first modular collection in 2007, and as of this writing, we have 21 of them. The Tudor Corner (10350) was released in 2025, while the Shopping Street (11371) is the latest release.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Within the collection, you’ll find hotels, cafés and shops, typical spots you get in a city landscape. The double-thick walls and the brick-built lettering give sets in this collection a unique look from the typical sets you get.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO modular sets are a fun way of constructing detailed builds. And thankfully, you can interconnect as many as you want, which is the focus of this guide.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at eBay:</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102982 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Levels.jpg" alt="" width="773" height="619" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Levels.jpg 773w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Levels-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Levels-768x615.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 773px) 100vw, 773px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to Expand Your LEGO Modular Sets</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Let’s say you’ve finally laid your hands on a LEGO modular set, like the Café Corner (10190). That is the beginning of a journey that has been fulfilling for me and many other fans out there. And I believe the set should be easy to assemble with just 2,058 pieces.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One thing you’ll notice about the modular sets is their baseplates. Almost all of them use the 32&#215;32 stud baseplates, meaning you can expand your landscape with more sets without things looking awkward. Even better, the official LEGO sets have the same scale, giving you that flushed, natural look once you put them all together. Yes, I could assemble all 21 LEGO modular sets, and they would look like one massive LEGO build because the buildings all share the same scale–kudos to LEGO on this one.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Note that the modular sets do not excel in exterior details alone. They also have intricate interior details, minifigures, and characters that highlight the typical city life.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102984 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.jpg" alt="" width="1118" height="336" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.jpg 1118w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-300x90.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-1024x308.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-768x231.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1118px) 100vw, 1118px" /></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">A Step-By-Step Guide</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Here are the steps that have helped me and will hopefully help you as well</span></p>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Purchase extra baseplates (the 32&#215;32 baseplates and the 48&#215;48 options for a larger footprint).</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use software to map out your city landscape. You can import different digital models and position them until you have your desired layout.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Decide if you will display your ultimate build on the table, on the floor, or on the shelf.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Consider foundation leveling if you have large table layouts.</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These are the foundational steps you need to start building your LEGO modular sets. The display option (table, floor, or shelf) will determine how you build. On the floor, you can stretch everything out on a level ground. But on a shelf, you may have to tier your modular buildings.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Another thing you’ll have to consider is MILS plates. These are modular integrated landscaping systems. They provide a sturdier base instead of building directly on baseplates. Trust me, many city builders have adopted this approach.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The MILS plates approach involves building a raised platform with Technic pins at the edge. With the Technic pins, you can connect adjacent plates to create a seamless and rigid connection between the plates. Note also that the MILS plates use the 32&#215;32 studs.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at eBay:</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-85603 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Minifigures.jpg" alt="" width="1366" height="582" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Minifigures.jpg 1366w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Minifigures-300x128.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Minifigures-1024x436.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Minifigures-768x327.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1366px) 100vw, 1366px" /></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">Expanding with Roads and Transit</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There’s no city without connecting roads, right? The same goes for your LEGO City, and I’m not referring to the regular </span><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/build-your-metropolis-with-the-best-lego-city-sets-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO City sets</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, which are impressive, by the way. Instead, I’m talking about modular sets.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Once you’ve built your foundation, the next step is to create the roads to facilitate transit. You can use the modern LEGO road plate system, which I recommend. An alternative is to use custom tile-built roads to build the streets between your blocks, but I’d leave that route for experienced builders if I were you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The next step is to integrate transit into your city. People, or in this case minifigures, have to move from one block to another. You can use cars or incorporate a LEGO train track behind your buildings. These will give your downtown an urban feel and are one of the biggest things that separate a beginner from a pro builder.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Don’t just stop at adding transit. Populate your streets with trees, vehicles, streetlamps, etc. If you are like me, you can also add minifigures walking down the street on the sidewalks. These will break up the hard plastic feel that LEGO sets typically come with.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102980 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="838" height="839" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 838w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x769.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 838px) 100vw, 838px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to Upgrade Your LEGO Modular Sets</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To me, upgrading simply means adding more buildings to expand the city&#8217;s look. A few notable modular buildings you should consider for your collection are:</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">1. Shopping Street</span></h3>
<p><b>Set number:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 11371</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-102992 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Functions-4.jpg" alt="" width="1112" height="624" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Functions-4.jpg 1112w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Functions-4-300x168.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Functions-4-1024x575.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Functions-4-768x431.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1112px) 100vw, 1112px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This impressive piece presents the perfect spot for the city dwellers to shop for what they need. You have the furniture mover, the music shop, and Brickley’s Store, all in one set. I can even set up the plumber minifigure to answer work calls.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Shopping Street has 3,456 pieces with several minifigures. It remains one of the most defining sets in any LEGO City landscape.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at eBay:</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">2. Tudor Corner</span></h3>
<p><b>Set number: </b><span style="font-weight: 400;">10350</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-92996 alignright" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-296x300.jpg" alt="" width="296" height="300" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-296x300.jpg 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x778.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 898w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 296px) 100vw, 296px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We got this set in 2025, and I’d get several of them if I could. It adds even more dynamism to the city life with its 3 brick-and-timber-style facades.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Within the building, you have a restaurant complete with a counter, stools, and a table. You also get a clockmaker’s workshop and a home office decor. The 8 minifigures bring even more life to the space, as you can pose them differently for display and storytelling.</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">3. Natural History Museum</span></h3>
<p><b>Set number:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 10326</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-85604 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023.jpg" alt="" width="1362" height="864" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023.jpg 1362w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-300x190.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-1024x650.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-768x487.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1362px) 100vw, 1362px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I know that all LEGO modular buildings are impressive, but if I were to pick a favorite, it would be the Natural History Museum. It has all the interior details you would expect, like the curator’s office, astronomy exhibits, ancient artifacts, and a galaxy view. There’s even a window washer to make things even more realistic.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at eBay:</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-85602 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="888" height="880" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Back-Box.jpg 888w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Back-Box-300x297.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Back-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/18-LEGO-Icons-10326-Natural-History-Museum-Modular-Building-Collection-December-2023-Back-Box-768x761.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 888px) 100vw, 888px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lighting Up Your Modular Buildings</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can either work with budget DIY lights or get commercial custom light kits for your build. Either way, here are a few tips that will help you along the way:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Decide if you will install the lights as you build or after the build.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Use stud gaps and underneath the plates to route and conceal the wires.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Work from the bottom up when lighting up your buildings.</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO &amp; Lighting Solutions at eBay:</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92997 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Floors-Inside.jpg" alt="" width="449" height="829" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Floors-Inside.jpg 449w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Icons-10350-Tudor-Corner-Modular-Building-Collection-January-2025-Release-Date-Floors-Inside-162x300.jpg 162w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 449px) 100vw, 449px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">How to Expand, Upgrade, and Light Up LEGO Modular Sets – Final Thoughts</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Taking the step forward to build modular sets is something I will always commend. It comes with its unique challenges. However, with the few tips I’ve provided, you should be off to a good start.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102985 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1102" height="737" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1102w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x201.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x685.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/18-LEGO-Icons-11371-Shopping-Street-Modular-Building-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x514.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1102px) 100vw, 1102px" /></p>
