										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-102718 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="914" height="768" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1025w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x252.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Marvel-76338-Mech-Battle-Spider-Man-vs.-Doc-Ock-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x645.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 914px) 100vw, 914px" /></p>
<p>Our favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Marvel-Mech-Battle-Minifigures/dp/B0FMS7W6RC?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=c143860b00199d89b74b8f7489162361&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Marvel Mech Battle: Spider-Man vs. Doc Ock 76338</a> at 20% off for <strong>$23.99</strong> (reg.$29.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Polaroid-Building-Collectible-Brick-Built/dp/B0CGY4H58V?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=b5ef55ca2374cd92b30d155fb35cb601&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas Polaroid OneStep SX-70 21345</a> at 18% off for <strong>$65.99</strong> (reg.$79.99). You also can&#8217;t go wrong with the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Cement-Mixer-Truck-Building/dp/B0FMSBTFR6?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=26ffb05060ef44764a4eb2c245e22281&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Cement Mixer 60478</a> at 18% off for <strong>$32.99</strong> (reg.$39.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-103298 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60478-Cement-Mixer-2.jpg" alt="" width="613" height="630" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60478-Cement-Mixer-2.jpg 825w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60478-Cement-Mixer-2-292x300.jpg 292w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/60478-Cement-Mixer-2-768x789.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87358 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="937" height="736" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1750w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x236.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x805.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x603.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box-1536x1207.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 937px) 100vw, 937px" /></p>
<p>Below are 12 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 30, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>12 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 30, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>40% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Champions-Mercedes-AMG-Minifigures-Convertible/dp/B0CV2HGNY9?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=50dff59c4a409f9b82efbb405ff7c5b0&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Speed Champions Mercedes-AMG G 63 &amp; SL 63 76924</a><strong> $26.99</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
<li>13% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6588546-TBD-Botanicals-11506/dp/B0G2SZQS1C?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=42f1ffdfd2ba7422e4f2e529ead6f18b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Botanicals Rocking Plants 11506</a> <strong>$19.97</strong> (reg.$22.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106265 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="669" height="707" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 767w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-284x300.jpg 284w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 669px) 100vw, 669px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-89461 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-.jpg" alt="" width="976" height="640" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-.jpg 1378w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--300x197.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--1024x672.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Speed-Champions-76924-Mercedes-AMG-G-63-Mercedes-AMG-SL-63-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box--768x504.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 976px) 100vw, 976px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>18% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Polaroid-Building-Collectible-Brick-Built/dp/B0CGY4H58V?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=b5ef55ca2374cd92b30d155fb35cb601&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas Polaroid OneStep SX-70 21345</a> <strong>$65.99</strong> (reg.$79.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Star-Wars-75408/dp/B0DJ1BXC2B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=05368fed6bfb7bb28c42adf9d802b19e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Star Wars Jango Fett Helmet 75408</a> <strong>$55.99</strong> (reg.$69.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-95869 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75408-Jango-Fett-Helmet-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="641" height="611" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75408-Jango-Fett-Helmet-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 902w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75408-Jango-Fett-Helmet-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x286.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75408-Jango-Fett-Helmet-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x732.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-87357 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="873" height="710" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1475w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x244.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x833.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21345-Polaroid-OneStep-SX-70-Camera-January-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x625.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 873px) 100vw, 873px" /></p>
