					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1350" height="1275" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/18-LEGO-ART-31215-Vincent-van-Gogh-–-Sunflowers-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO ART 31215 Vincent van Gogh – Sunflowers March 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/18-LEGO-ART-31215-Vincent-van-Gogh-–-Sunflowers-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1350w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/18-LEGO-ART-31215-Vincent-van-Gogh-–-Sunflowers-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x283.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/18-LEGO-ART-31215-Vincent-van-Gogh-–-Sunflowers-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x967.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/18-LEGO-ART-31215-Vincent-van-Gogh-–-Sunflowers-March-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x725.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1350px) 100vw, 1350px" /></p>
<p>Happy Friday Morning LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/7-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-october-30-2026/">7 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, October 30, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
