										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Friday Morning LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109631 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1058" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box-300x240.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box-1024x820.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box-768x615.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Minecraft-21595-The-Ender-Dragon-June-2026-Back-Box-1536x1231.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1058px) 100vw, 1058px" /></p>
<p>My top picks include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6585543-TBD-Minecraft-21595/dp/B0G2T18VCZ?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=95fdde0b036d759eff0cfc40693cc72c&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Minecraft The Ender Dragon 21595</a> at 16% off for<strong> $58.99</strong> (reg.$69.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Technic-1966-Building-Adults/dp/B0FMS7HMNN?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e4776c4020c03ef0ac5a953f40a01f7e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Technic 1966 Ford GT40 MKII Race Car 42223</a> at 20% off for <strong>$59.99</strong> (reg.$74.99).</p>
