<h2>LEGO Retiring Soon List: November 2026</h2>
<p>The Endurance is a highlight for ship-model fans, with three masts, fabric sails, and a connection to Shackleton’s Antarctic expedition. For a different kind of display, The Starry Night recreates Van Gogh’s swirling sky in three dimensions. These are just two of the 184 sets listed below and organized by theme with set numbers.</p>
